<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 600s BCE</p><h1 class="research-title">The 7th century BCE</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 600s BCE, 325 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 81 were founded and 32 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Assyrian Empire, the State of Qin and the State of Chu.</p></header>
